REFERENCE  (J,PR/C,108,025804,2023)
PART-DET   (N)
INC-SOURCE (LCS)
SAMPLE     - Chemical-form of target is element.
           - Physical-form of target is solid.
METHOD     (RINGR)
FACILITY   (SRING,2JPNHIT) NewSUBARU
ANALYSIS   (UNFLD)
DETECTOR   (PROPC) 20 3He proportional counters to measure the
                   emitted neutrons
           (NAICR) to measure LCS beam flux measurement
           (LABR3) to measure the energy profiles of the produced
                   gamma-ray beams
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-1) efficiency determination of the neutron
                   detector (about 3.2%)
           (ERR-2) pile-up method (about 1%)
           (ERR-S,4.4,5.0) the number of detected neutrons
                           (4.4-5.0%)
           (DATA-ERR) The error bars represent the statistical
                      errors and the systematic error due to the
                      uncertainty in the absolute efficiency
                      calibration of the neutron detector.
